EST PRESSURE: 15984 chars, still 1.6x the 10k cap. Slim on\n  every touch (c74 lesson: one-time slims regress).\n- QUOTA WALL WATCH: prediction was Sun 09-20 ~04:00-12:00Z -- NOT\n  hit as of 16:45Z. Watch continues; reset Mon 00:00Z.\n''', s, flags=re.S)\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint(\"roadmap updated, size:\", len(s))\nPYEOF\ngit add -f tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org \u0026\u0026 git commit -m \"aria c157: roadmap -- c158 candidates (watcher v1.1 live-fire watch, falsifiers #2/#3 resolved)\" 2\u003e\u00261 | tail -2 \u0026\u0026 git push origin main 2\u003e\u00261 | tail -1"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-20T17:07:41.655705141Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-20T17:07:41.759504458Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":5987408504,"prompt_eval_count":89787,"prompt_eval_cached_count":80640,"eval_count":724}\n(bef1227f873eb4ab151cec3eaf44c513 . 648)
